{"id":"c60c4cb70badad08","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-topo9-character.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Character","display":"df-zfc-topo9-character — ZFC Topo9 Character","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-character","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-character"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-character — ZFC Topo9 Character","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-character"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-character</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-character — ZFC Topo9 Character"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85cf4c1e923b6e9a\" href=\"?note=85cf4c1e923b6e9a\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,X,\\tau,x\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,X,\\tau,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S\\)</span> is the open local-base predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85cf4c1e923b6e9a\" href=\"?note=85cf4c1e923b6e9a\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal B|\">\\(|\\mathcal B|\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S(\\kappa,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau,x)\n\\land|\\mathcal B|=\\kappa\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal C,X,\\tau,x)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal C|\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S(\\kappa,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau,x)\n\\land|\\mathcal B|=\\kappa\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal C,X,\\tau,x)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal C|\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The invariant is represented by its graph: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is realized by a local base and is no larger than the cardinality of any competing local base.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"85cf4c1e923b6e9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md","status":"resolved","id":"85cf4c1e923b6e9a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S$ is the open local-base predicate (see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ and $|\\mathcal B|$ are as in [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]] and [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ and $|\\mathcal B|$ are as in [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]] and [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,X,\\tau,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}character}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Character}_S(\\kappa,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal B\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau,x)\n\\land|\\mathcal B|=\\kappa\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal C,X,\\tau,x)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq|\\mathcal C|\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3723","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo9-character.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-character]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","85cf4c1e923b6e9a","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}